ont-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p> <p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">문의</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">053-580-6009(</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-size: 12pt;\">교무학사팀</span><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p> <p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">2026. 9.</span></p> <p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 155%; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: '맑은 고딕'; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">교 무 처 장</span></p> <p><br></p> </div> <div class=\"attachment\"> <span class=\"no-file\">첨부파일이(가) 없습니다.</span> </div> </div> <div class=\"btns\"> <div class=\"board-button view\"> <form name=\"listForm\" method=\"post\" action=\"/bbs/coe/154/artclList.do\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"layout\" value=\"\" /> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page\" value=\"1\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"findType\" value=\"\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"findWord\" value=\"\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"clSeq\" value=\"\"/> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"opnwrdSeq\" value=\"\" /> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"rgsBgndeStr\" value=\"\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"rgsEnddeStr\" value=\"\"> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"c